cease_contact_letter.body:
To {{lender_name}},

RE: DEMAND TO CEASE UNLAWFUL CONTACT AND DATA USE

This is a formal notice. On {{dates}}, you {{what_happened}}. This included {{data_misused}}.

I OBJECT to the processing of my personal information and my contacts for debt collection, and I DEMAND that you immediately:
1. Stop calling, messaging, or contacting me outside lawful, reasonable hours and channels;
2. Stop contacting any third party in my phonebook or any person who is not a party to this debt;
3. Delete contact data you obtained from my device.

Under POPIA I have the right to object to this processing. Continued abusive contact after this notice will be reported to the Information Regulator and, where applicable, the National Credit Regulator, and may be used as evidence.

This letter does not admit the debt or waive any of my rights.

Case reference (my record): {{case_ref}}
Date served: {{dates}}

{{redacted_name}}
